*HEADING
 hand-written test of mesh generation semantics (compared node by node with Abaqus)
** Every node of interest carries a MASS element, because the output database only
** keeps nodes that some element uses.
**
** ---- A. *NGEN along a parabola (extra point = midpoint, given by coordinates)
